OL,3,GNEWSABoy, 15, and man stabbed in house
OL,4,Aby masked men
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenage boy and a man have been
OL,7,Fstabbed after two masked men entered a
OL,8,Fhouse in Leicestershire.
OL,10,FPolice were called to reports of a
OL,11,Fdisturbance at a house in Station Road,
OL,12,FThurnby, shortly before 00:30 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThey said the man in his 50s and the
OL,16,Fboy, 15, were both stabbed multiple
OL,17,Ftimes and remain in a critical
OL,18,Fcondition in hospital.
OL,20,FFirearms officers were called to the
OL,21,Fhouse, but the offenders had left, the
OL,22,Fforce said.
